{"key":"apphycem-mcq-009","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"zero","working":"By definition, in electrostatic equilibrium, all charges are at rest and there is no macroscopic current flow (J = 0). Since a conductor contains mobile charge carriers that respond to electric fields according to F = qE (or J = σE), any non-zero electric field inside the conducting material would cause these mobile charges to accelerate and flow. Thus, charges redistribute on the surface until the internal electric field is completely canceled, resulting in E = 0 everywhere within the conducting material.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":346,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":346,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":372,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":133,"reasoningTokens":239},"totalTokens":718,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":239,"promptTokenCount":346,"candidatesTokenCount":133,"totalTokenCount":718,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":346}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":133}]},"reasoningTokens":239,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":3716,"keyed_label":"B"}
{"key":"apphycem-mcq-009","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"zero","working":"In electrostatic equilibrium, charges in a conductor are at rest. If there were any nonzero electric field inside the conducting material, free charges would experience a force and move, producing a current. Since equilibrium requires no net motion of charge, the internal electric field must be zero. Excess charge resides on the conductor's surface, and the field just outside is perpendicular to the surface, but inside the material E = 0.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":403,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":147,"cacheReadTokens":256},"outputTokens":262,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":114,"reasoningTokens":148},"totalTokens":665,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":403,"completion_tokens":262,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":147,"total_tokens":665,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":148}},"reasoningTokens":148,"cachedInputTokens":256},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":3348,"keyed_label":"B"}
