{"key":"apphycem-mcq-025","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"local field but zero net flux contribution","working":"The electric field at any point is the superposition of fields from all charges, both inside and outside the Gaussian surface. Therefore, outside charges do contribute to the local electric field on and near the surface. However, Gauss's law says the net electric flux through a closed surface depends only on the enclosed charge: net flux = Q_enc/ε0. Field lines from outside charges enter and leave the surface, so their net flux contribution is zero. Thus outside charges affect the local field but not the net flux.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":413,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":157,"cacheReadTokens":256},"outputTokens":470,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":140,"reasoningTokens":330},"totalTokens":883,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":413,"completion_tokens":470,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":157,"total_tokens":883,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":330}},"reasoningTokens":330,"cachedInputTokens":256},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4516,"keyed_label":"B"}
{"key":"apphycem-mcq-026","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"increases","working":"The electric potential energy U of two point charges q_1 and q_2 separated by a distance r is given by U = (1 / (4πε_0)) * (q_1 * q_2 / r). Since both charges are positive, the product q_1 * q_2 is positive, making U > 0. As the charges are brought closer together, the separation distance r decreases, which causes the potential energy U to increase. Alternatively, an external agent must do positive work against the repulsive electrostatic force to push the charges together, thereby increasing the electric potential energy of the system.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":343,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":343,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":338,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":160,"reasoningTokens":178},"totalTokens":681,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":178,"promptTokenCount":343,"candidatesTokenCount":160,"totalTokenCount":681,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":343}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":160}]},"reasoningTokens":178,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":3248,"keyed_label":"B"}
