{"key":"apphycem-mcq-029","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"normal to the surface","working":"In electrostatic equilibrium, charges on a conductor are stationary. If there were any tangential component of the electric field at the conductor's surface, mobile surface charges would experience a force along the surface and accelerate, violating the condition of equilibrium. Therefore, the tangential electric field at the surface must be zero, meaning the electric field just outside a conductor must be entirely normal (perpendicular) to the surface, with magnitude E = σ/ε₀.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":353,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":353,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":318,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":127,"reasoningTokens":191},"totalTokens":671,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":191,"promptTokenCount":353,"candidatesTokenCount":127,"totalTokenCount":671,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":353}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":127}]},"reasoningTokens":191,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":2811,"keyed_label":"B"}
{"key":"apphycem-mcq-028","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"lower potential and lower U","working":"A positive charge in an electric field experiences force in the direction of E. The electric potential decreases in the direction of E, so the charge moves toward lower potential. Its potential energy is U = qV with q > 0, so as V decreases, U also decreases. Released from rest, it gains kinetic energy, so kinetic energy is not unchanged. Thus the correct tendency is lower potential and lower U.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":420,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":36,"cacheReadTokens":384},"outputTokens":593,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":118,"reasoningTokens":475},"totalTokens":1013,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":420,"completion_tokens":593,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":384,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":36,"total_tokens":1013,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":384},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":475}},"reasoningTokens":475,"cachedInputTokens":384},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":6126,"keyed_label":"B"}
